2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148772 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:75 *** Any attempt to activate a frequency-hopping channel (h=1) triggers      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148784 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:76 *** an immediate assertion crash of the virtual PHY process.                ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148795 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:77 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148801 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:78 *** Real frequency hopping requires:                                        ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148804 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:79 ***   - RF hardware with synchronized frequency synthesizer                 ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148808 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:80 ***   - TDMA frame-accurate hopping sequence generation                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148811 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:81 ***   - Physical RF carrier switching at 217 hops/second                    ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148815 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:82 *** None of these are possible in the GSMTAP-based virtual environment.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148819 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:84 --- LIMIT-2: Multi-Cell Handover Infrastructure Not Available ---
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148830 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:85 *** Spec line [4] +StartCellB_ho starts a second cell (Cell B) for HO.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148834 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:86 *** Non-synchronised handover requires:                                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148837 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:87 ***   - Two independent BTS instances (Cell A + Cell B)                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148841 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:88 ***   - Frame-level timing offset management (non-coincident timeslots)     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148844 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:89 ***   - Spec comment line 42: 'The timeslots of Cells A and B are not      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148848 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:90 ***     coincident at the antenna connector.'                               ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148852 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:91 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148855 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:92 *** Current infrastructure: single osmo-bts-virtual + single virtphy.       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148858 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:93 *** No mechanism exists to instantiate or coordinate a second BTS cell.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148862 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:94 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148866 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:95 *** OM_StartCell() operations in the spec require BSC-level cell activation ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148869 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:96 *** control not exposed via the MSC stub interface. The bsc-stub does not   ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148873 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:97 *** implement multi-cell coordination or second-BTS channel activation.     ***
