2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148903 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:106 ***   - Precise injection of PHYSICAL INFORMATION message at L1              ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148910 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:107 ***   - Measuring MS response within sub-millisecond timing windows          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148914 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:108 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148918 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:109 *** osmo-virtphy does not maintain a real TDMA frame clock. GSMTAP packet   ***
